1
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:06,340
Let's show up what we've got, Kaido. Huh?

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,820
The whole shebang.

3
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,920
We'll see how many survive.

4
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:17,650
Trafalgar!

5
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:18,700
Use your power!

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,509
Why aren't you teleporting
them downstairs?

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,017
If I could, I would have done it already.

8
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,688
Their Haki is too strong.

9
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,637
I can't get these two out of here.

10
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:30,720
In that case, we'll do it by force.

11
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:36,490
Damn it!

12
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:38,120
Here comes a big one!

13
00:01:06,360 --> 00:01:09,137
Hope your stiff old joints
are still holding up.

14
00:01:09,220 --> 00:01:10,161
Did you stretch?

15
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:13,800
I'll stretch that skin
off your skull, old man!

16
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:24,400
Conquest of the sea!

17
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,260
How the hell do you fight that?

18
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,580
We'll never dodge this.

19
00:01:46,380 --> 00:01:48,700
Get away! Hurry!

20
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:02,380
Get out of here, Simmons!

21
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:04,480
You're gonna get off!

22
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:05,830
And...

23
00:02:05,913 --> 00:02:06,743
Hurrah!

24
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,160
I can hear their voices.

25
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,285
They're around here somewhere.

26
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,894
I guess they got away.

27
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,105
They're better than I thought.

28
00:02:37,620 --> 00:02:38,680
Hey, Zora.

29
00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:40,180
You still alive?

30
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,560
I think so.

31
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:47,320
Nice job blocking that, even for a sack.

32
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,740
You saved us.

33
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:51,000
Where's Straw Hat? Ugh!

34
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:57,860
Kaido!

35
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,740
Red Hawk!

36
00:03:13,820 --> 00:03:15,440
Hey, Kaido!

37
00:03:15,760 --> 00:03:16,840
You moved!

38
00:03:17,100 --> 00:03:18,420
Was it gonna hurt?

39
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,600
Woo!

40
00:04:00,780 --> 00:04:03,580
Let's go!

41
00:04:10,220 --> 00:04:13,020
Thank you.

42
00:05:31,300 --> 00:05:32,880
The End

43
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,237
There's a pile of explosives here, right?

44
00:05:35,320 --> 00:05:37,020
Yes, I shall take them down.

45
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:41,584
The castle will burn to
the ground at this rate!

46
00:05:44,440 --> 00:05:45,720
Screw you, Kaido!

47
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:48,737
And screw your new Onigashima
project too, dammit!

48
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:49,650
Orochi!

49
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,080
So, this is your doing, is it?

50
00:05:52,280 --> 00:05:54,537
Look who crawled out
of their graves again!

51
00:05:54,620 --> 00:05:57,267
I suppose you ghosts
are surprised to see me!

52
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:00,137
What exactly is your goal here?

53
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:04,044
It's been 20 years and you still
won't drop this blasted crusade!

54
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,318
You hunted me down!

55
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,440
All the way here!

56
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:10,140
Has your hate for me really
fueled you all this time?

57
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:15,231
Lord Orochi, it may be worth noting
that they didn't witness your execution.

58
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:16,870
Better to run.

59
00:06:16,953 --> 00:06:17,900
I'll handle them.

60
00:06:18,140 --> 00:06:19,120
Shut your mouth!

61
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,140
How dare you!

62
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:23,714
It looks like you took quite a beating.

63
00:06:23,980 --> 00:06:25,637
Is that why you've come to me?

64
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,577
You're all half dead and you want
me to finish the job for you?

65
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:32,717
Or did somebody hit your heads too
hard and now you've lost your minds?

66
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:34,300
Step aside, Odochi.

67
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:36,877
We won't allow you to
waste any more of our time.

68
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:39,360
Then what happens if I say no? What?

69
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,917
Who the hell you think you
are looking down on me?

70
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,460
I'm the Shogun of the land of Wano!

71
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:02,840
You exist by my grace alone!

72
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:07,480
Stop at me, will you?

73
00:07:07,760 --> 00:07:10,348
My actions have been
justified from the sky!

74
00:07:11,660 --> 00:07:14,860
I had every right to take
revenge on the Kozuki clan!

75
00:07:15,140 --> 00:07:18,258
I had every right to take
what should have been mine!

76
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:29,160
Do you really think
you're the heroes here?

77
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:32,197
Citizens are supposed to
bow before their shogun,

78
00:07:32,280 --> 00:07:36,045
not just from the peace Don't you
know the meaning of authority?

79
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:39,860
Flower shuriken!

80
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:44,000
This country oppressed me!

81
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,980
It deserves what it gets!

82
00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:55,160
Don't look at me like that.

83
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:03,280
That silent judgment almost did it.

84
00:08:03,860 --> 00:08:04,690
Stop it.

85
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:06,240
Don't look at me.

86
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,860
I'm the victim, don't you see?

87
00:08:10,640 --> 00:08:13,500
Stop staring at me. No!

88
00:08:25,980 --> 00:08:27,100
Lord Orochi!

89
00:08:27,840 --> 00:08:30,487
I'll let them decide
your punishment in hell.

90
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,750
Onward!

91
00:08:34,580 --> 00:08:36,660
Are you going to avenge your lord?

92
00:08:37,400 --> 00:08:39,753
Seems you have some integrity after all.

93
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:43,725
Even though he was a fool, you
stayed loyal to him till the end.

94
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:46,037
Ironic hearing that
from you of all people.

95
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:48,580
But you and I are destined to fight!

96
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,998
I don't need vengeance as an excuse!

97
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:53,600
Wouldn't you agree, Ryzo? Indeed!

98
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,060
Let's go!

99
00:08:57,600 --> 00:09:00,040
Don't underestimate me, Brook!

100
00:09:16,220 --> 00:09:17,050
Ah!

101
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,940
Back it up, lady!

102
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:31,160
I'll take you all on!

103
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:41,940
Go get him!

104
00:09:42,140 --> 00:09:43,300
Pull it together!

105
00:09:44,740 --> 00:09:45,570
Ready!

106
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:51,220
Oh!

107
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,400
Oh, no!

108
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:13,460
Cockerel of free world!

109
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:30,080
It's time for us to take out the crash!

110
00:10:34,320 --> 00:10:36,700
It's done. My turn. Now, roll.

111
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:38,830
Shambles.

112
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:44,100
Damn it, Zeus!

113
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:45,980
Can you do it, Roradoa?

114
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,880
Do I have a choice?

115
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:56,280
I won't let you go back to her!

116
00:10:57,140 --> 00:10:58,020
Flame red!

117
00:10:58,420 --> 00:10:59,773
Crossing the six pound!

118
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,480
No, no, no!

119
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,497
Stop the violence!

120
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:06,357
I'm just kidding, innocent guard!

121
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,560
Bobo, help me, please!

122
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:10,100
I'm coming!

123
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:11,382
Now's a chance!

124
00:11:11,780 --> 00:11:13,400
Puck pistol, no! Oh!

125
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:16,650
Pathetic!

126
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:20,097
You thought you could win if
you took my homies away, huh?

127
00:11:20,180 --> 00:11:21,720
I'll crush you!

128
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:27,600
Don't push it!

129
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:31,000
You're a pal!

130
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,540
In tact!

131
00:11:37,900 --> 00:11:38,960
You idiot!

132
00:11:39,380 --> 00:11:42,380
You think you'll beat me
by hitting me with a rock?

133
00:11:57,600 --> 00:12:01,380
If there's no one to catch
her, then that's one down.

134
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:04,900
How was that?

135
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:11,560
Help me, Zos, where are you?

136
00:12:16,580 --> 00:12:17,900
Where are you?

137
00:12:20,820 --> 00:12:23,060
Don't you worry, I'm on my way!

138
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:31,360
Just wait one second, Mama!

139
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,720
That bastard's tough.

140
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:50,300
How is he standing?

141
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:53,057
That attack probably
broke half of his bones.

142
00:12:53,140 --> 00:12:54,480
What is he made of?

143
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,240
Pathetic, Lin-Lin.

144
00:12:57,420 --> 00:12:58,780
You got sloppy.

145
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:03,060
Guess I gotta do this job on my own.

146
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,260
Hey, Tyrant Hunter!

147
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:09,460
Let him go!

148
00:13:09,740 --> 00:13:11,240
I'm warning you!

149
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:14,960
Time for shambles!

150
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,620
Injection shot!

151
00:13:24,620 --> 00:13:28,780
I don't know what you did,
but I don't like it one bit.

152
00:13:29,360 --> 00:13:30,400
Now die!

153
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:31,896
Anti-bacterial cart!

154
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:36,790
Oh!

155
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:40,590
Mama!

156
00:13:42,220 --> 00:13:43,520
No way!

157
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,400
Hold on!

158
00:13:45,660 --> 00:13:46,580
I'm coming!

159
00:13:47,260 --> 00:13:48,090
Mama!

160
00:13:55,160 --> 00:13:57,140
Pull it together, Drop!

161
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:58,840
That fire thing!

162
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:01,697
It's gonna save Big Mom
if we don't do something!

163
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:02,610
It's gonna save Big Mom
if we don't do something!

164
00:14:02,693 --> 00:14:03,523
Ah!

165
00:14:03,606 --> 00:14:04,436
Quick!

166
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:07,200
It doesn't matter, let it go.

167
00:14:09,100 --> 00:14:11,060
I don't want one of us to die.

168
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,541
I'd rather have the mission fail.

169
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:24,340
You don't have to worry!

170
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:27,541
All we had to do was tear
Big Mom and Kaido apart!

171
00:14:27,860 --> 00:14:31,154
We've come far enough, no
need to throw your lives away!

172
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:39,100
I'll take care of Big Mom for you!

173
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,760
Oh, you saved me!

174
00:14:47,660 --> 00:14:50,200
That sure was a close one, wasn't it?

175
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:57,000
Oh, my sweet, adorable Prometheus.

176
00:14:57,460 --> 00:14:59,160
Thank you so much.

177
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:03,160
But somebody didn't bother.

178
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,480
Zeus, where the hell are you?

179
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:08,040
That useless idiot.

180
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:12,260
What a pity.

181
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:15,340
He really let you down, didn't he?

182
00:15:15,700 --> 00:15:19,500
You can't rely on that lazy chunk
to do anything if you ask me.

183
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:21,120
Yeah, you're right!

184
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:27,480
I don't suppose I could ask
for a favor, could I? Huh?

185
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:28,780
What is it?

186
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:51,117
That's funny.

187
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:52,860
Can you believe that face?

188
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,977
That cold stare.

189
00:15:55,060 --> 00:15:57,360
Just like last time.

190
00:15:57,580 --> 00:16:01,051
Even though he's unconscious,
the voice still glared at me.

191
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:04,560
You got something you
wanna say, you little punk.

192
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:12,920
If you don't get up soon, I'm gonna
smash those eyeballs right in.

193
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:16,560
And then the rest of your skull.

194
00:16:17,040 --> 00:16:18,237
And your face.

195
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,200
And your heart, too!

196
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,800
Hey Traffy...

197
00:16:25,060 --> 00:16:29,413
I've got one good move left of me, and
it's going to push me to the limit.

198
00:16:30,380 --> 00:16:31,480
You're kidding me.

199
00:16:31,820 --> 00:16:34,517
Anything less than my
best wouldn't be enough.

200
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,240
It would just wear me down.

201
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:40,440
Either this attack works or I'd die.

202
00:16:40,860 --> 00:16:42,625
Maybe it's just my time to go.

203
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:47,120
If this is it for me, good luck.

204
00:16:59,260 --> 00:17:00,940
Hey, Taito!

205
00:17:05,240 --> 00:17:08,140
I got a duty to protect my captain.

206
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:13,400
You want to smash your head in that bad?

207
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:16,880
Try mine first, if you think you can.

208
00:17:22,040 --> 00:17:23,060
Demon order!

209
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:24,740
Nine-sword style!

210
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:28,980
Asterok!

211
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:30,857
Blades drawn!

212
00:17:30,940 --> 00:17:32,940
Come on!

213
00:17:53,260 --> 00:17:56,020
Nine swords die out!

214
00:18:14,700 --> 00:18:19,860
Usher, blade drawn Dead man's kill

215
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:50,980
He cut me.

216
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:57,600
This breath?

217
00:18:58,260 --> 00:19:00,480
So you have it as well?

218
00:19:00,940 --> 00:19:02,840
That was conquerors, Haki.

219
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:04,740
Oh, yeah?

220
00:19:05,040 --> 00:19:07,216
You think that means something to me?

221
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:11,507
Whatever you call it,
it still wasn't enough.

222
00:19:13,840 --> 00:19:17,740
That was all my strength,
and you barely even flinched.

223
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:25,700
I was hoping you'd fall
to your knees, at least.

224
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:28,237
Well, you should be proud, kid.

225
00:19:28,320 --> 00:19:31,520
You've given me a scar
that will never fade.

226
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:43,109
Regeneration has
certainly earned its name.

227
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,700
Zoro! Run! Hurry!

228
00:19:56,680 --> 00:19:59,000
You stay right there.

229
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:01,020
Save yourself the trouble.

230
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:03,560
I'll come to you. Thunder!

231
00:20:04,700 --> 00:20:05,580
Mabwa!

232
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:35,897
it's a damn shame if you join
me we could have conquered the

233
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:40,920
world together if we joined you
why the hell would we ever join you

234
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:47,360
we'll do anything to help the samurai

235
00:20:52,580 --> 00:20:55,400
I'll kick your ass no matter what!

236
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:57,340
You want to repeat that?

237
00:20:58,880 --> 00:21:01,180
You'll kick my ass?

238
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:12,900
Alright, go ahead and try it then.

239
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:16,675
You're not the type to think
before you punch, are you?

240
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:18,780
You got something left?

241
00:21:19,100 --> 00:21:19,980
Show me!

242
00:21:25,260 --> 00:21:27,440
You need to pull back.

243
00:21:27,720 --> 00:21:28,779
It's quite simple.

244
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:31,717
Haki, as you call it,
coats your entire body.

245
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:35,060
It can be used as invisible
armor or as a weapon.

246
00:21:35,320 --> 00:21:37,940
And then, when you push beyond its limits,

247
00:21:38,380 --> 00:21:41,197
your Haki doesn't simply
fortify your strength.

248
00:21:41,280 --> 00:21:45,380
It penetrates the enemy's body
and destroys it from within.

249
00:21:48,460 --> 00:21:50,320
Don't overstress yourself!

250
00:21:50,960 --> 00:21:55,019
Let the Haki flow to your fist from
the parts that aren't using it!

251
00:21:57,220 --> 00:21:58,740
Of God!

252
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:07,880
The last time, it was too shallow.

253
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:12,400
In the midst of danger is
when true power blooms.

254
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:18,216
But I figured it out when
you attacked with your club.

255
00:22:21,560 --> 00:22:24,266
You can infuse things
with Conqueror's Haki.

256
00:22:29,700 --> 00:22:32,180
How exactly will knowing that help you?

257
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:34,920
You think you can do it too?

258
00:22:46,360 --> 00:22:50,257
this is the privilege
of the strong a dead man

259
00:22:50,340 --> 00:22:54,360
walking like you couldn't
dream of it i'll show you

260
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:21,310
Wow. Wow.

261
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:56,020
Don't overstress yourself!

262
00:23:56,400 --> 00:24:00,753
Let the Haki flow through your fist
from the parts that aren't using it!

263
00:24:57,480 --> 00:24:59,300
He didn't even touch her.

264
00:25:31,260 --> 00:25:32,660
Zoro!

265
00:25:36,780 --> 00:25:37,610
Traffy.

266
00:25:37,693 --> 00:25:40,960
Thanks for protecting
me, but I'm good now.

267
00:25:43,280 --> 00:25:44,957
You two should head downstairs.

268
00:25:45,040 --> 00:25:46,720
I know I can do it.

269
00:25:46,960 --> 00:25:48,720
I won't lose this time.

270
00:25:56,360 --> 00:25:57,917
Tell everyone else.

271
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,360
We're gonna win!

